<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Love You So</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">Leonie Biney, Rin</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">It Could Have Been Nice</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">4OdZEu2JFWP4k9eM12TBBW</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.560" end="00:17.640">We’ve had a little much too drink</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.640" end="00:23.760">Your ears, and nose, and cheeks are pink</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.760" end="00:31.760">The water from the kitchen sink never tasted so good</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.020" end="00:38.340">The leaves are slowly turning brown</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.340" end="00:43.440">Let’s go somewhere we won’t be found</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.440" end="00:51.440">I’d kiss you but I forgot how, will you teach me again?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.680" end="01:00.360">And again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.360" end="01:07.410">Oh, I’ve never claimed to be good with cold weather</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.410" end="01:15.410">Gone is summer but you’re still keeping me warm(er)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.060" end="01:27.900">If I loved you less, I could explain it more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.900" end="01:29.520">But know for sure, my love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.520" end="01:35.670">I love you so</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.670" end="01:43.670">La da da dum</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.090" end="01:50.280">I haven’t felt this way in years</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.280" end="01:52.620">My voice is wanting you to hear</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.620" end="01:59.310">I’d tell you but I forgot how</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.310" end="02:06.000">Will you teach me again?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.000" end="02:12.420">And again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.420" end="02:19.050">Oh, I’ve never claimed to be good with cold weather</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.050" end="02:27.050">Gone is summer but you’re still keeping me warm(er)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.060" end="02:39.330">If I loved you less, I could explain it more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:39.330" end="02:41.430">But know for sure, my love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.430" end="02:48.000">I love you so</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:48.000" end="02:56.000">La da da dum</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:56.730" end="03:01.830">La da da dum</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:01.830" end="03:03.330">La da da dum</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:02.760" end="03:06.760">Oh</p></div></body></tt>